{"3697210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zodiac Requiem", "steam_appid": 3697210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zodiac Requiem</i> features a <strong>top-down perspective</strong> with a <strong>mini-map UI</strong>, allowing players to clearly track their surroundings and enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2693b9415d41af816726929c5ee43ae0.avif?t=1785724557\" width=1000 height=547 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring unique exploration experiences even in repeated areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1785724557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras_big/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1785724557 width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop <strong>weapons of varying rarities and affixes</strong>, with 12 major weapon classes (rifles, sniper rifles, pistols, etc.) and detailed subclass customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9dc30808dbcf71ff7e98fc8eb74ae145.avif?t=1785724557\" width=616 height=992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 12 <strong>Zodiac-themed final bosses</strong> – experiment with weapon builds to conquer these <strong>Souls-like difficulty encounters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2ec9b47fcea7140d6f0fd630bca20153.avif?t=1785724557\" width=616 height=580 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zodiac Requiem</i> features a <strong>top-down perspective</strong> with a <strong>mini-map UI</strong>, allowing players to clearly track their surroundings and enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2693b9415d41af816726929c5ee43ae0.avif?t=1785724557\" width=1000 height=547 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring unique exploration experiences even in repeated areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1785724557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras_big/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1785724557 width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop <strong>weapons of varying rarities and affixes</strong>, with 12 major weapon classes (rifles, sniper rifles, pistols, etc.) and detailed subclass customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9dc30808dbcf71ff7e98fc8eb74ae145.avif?t=1785724557\" width=616 height=992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 12 <strong>Zodiac-themed final bosses</strong> – experiment with weapon builds to conquer these <strong>Souls-like difficulty encounters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2ec9b47fcea7140d6f0fd630bca20153.avif?t=1785724557\" width=616 height=580 /></span></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/f81b20db167d79b64504b5a6791e0285c35ac7d8/header.jpg?t=1785724557", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/9a21f57517d2903e0a7a6c4b65acfbf9360aba0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785724557", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/9a21f57517d2903e0a7a6c4b65acfbf9360aba0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785724557", "website": "https://space.bilibili.com/383734716", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str